<item>
<ptxt>Vehicle speed signal malfunction between vehicle speed sensor and instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</ptxt>
